<title>UK: SOCCER-SCOTLAND BEAT ESTONIA 2-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SCOTLAND BEAT ESTONIA 2-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>KILMARNOCK, Scotland 1997-03-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scotland beat</p>
<p>Estonia 2-0 (halftime 1-0) in their World Cup group four</p>
<p>qualifer on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers - Tom Boyd 25, Janek Meet (own goal) 53.</p>
<p>Attendance: 17,996.</p>
<p>Standings:</p>
<p>			 P  W   D   L   F   A   Pts</p>
<p> Scotland	    5  3   2   0   5   0   11</p>
<p> Austria	     3  2   1   0   3   1    7</p>
<p> Sweden		4  2   0   2   7   4    6</p>
<p> Estonia	     4  1   1   2   1   3    4</p>
<p> Belarus	     4  1   1   2   3   7    4</p>
<p> Latvia		4  0   1   3   3   7    1</p>
<p>Remaining matches:</p>
<p>1997:</p>
<p>April 2 - Scotland v Austria</p>
<p>April 30 - Austria v Estonia</p>
<p>April 30 - Sweden v Scotland</p>
<p>April 30 - Latvia v Belarus</p>
<p>May 18  - Estonia v Latvia</p>
<p>June 8  - Latvia v Austria</p>
<p>June 8  - Estonia v Sweden</p>
<p>June 8  - Belarus v Scotland</p>
<p>Aug 20  - Estonia v Austria</p>
<p>Aug 20  - Belarus v Sweden</p>
<p>Sept 6  - Austria v Sweden</p>
<p>Sept 6  - Latvia v Estonia</p>
<p>Sept 6  - Scotland v Belarus</p>
<p>Sept 10 - Belarus v Austria</p>
<p>Sept 10 - Sweden v Latvia</p>
<p>Oct 11  - Austria v Belarus</p>
<p>Oct 11  - Sweden v Estonia</p>
<p>Oct 11  - Scotland v Latvia</p>
